  "description": "Eun-Seo, an assistant director at a broadcasting station, gets a chance to become a producer—if she secures an exclusive interview. The catch? Her target is Choi Kwon-Hoo, the second son of a rival family; and also her brother-in-law. However, her family is currently entangled in a messy divorce.\n\nHoping to use an old IOU as leverage, Eun-Seo tries to persuade him, but Kwon-Hoo counters with a shocking deal: he’ll agree to the interview if she accepts a costly ring worth 100 times the debt.\n\nTaking the ring could make her a traitor to her family, but Eun-Seo decides to go through with it—only to realise she may have stepped into something far more complicated.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66099761), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%B0%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8/4397)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177835)",
